#: scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a82955ac2efbb35247e024cd708b6bdc3f90c9511cfee745270caf886f07393
