msgid "⟪k:0⟫(So if anything’s motivating me,⟪k:1⟫it’s not concern for the boy,)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Perciò, se c’è qualcosa che mi sta motivando,⟪k:1⟫non è l’interessamento per quel ragazzo,)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 836fa4ad5dde8f43038b9bd03b0b1dad3b0fca6f14835b1c16634a63569ff98e
#. default-sha256: aa2af6e99af384ad7c5d4f6ecc059247ead53ff313580da9e64698514074368d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It didn’t take much arm-twisting to get him to give us a room, so who knows, maybe "
"he’ll come over to our side easier than either of us expect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non è servito pressarlo più di tanto per ottenere una stanza, quindi chissà, "
"magari passerà dalla nostra parte più facilmente del previsto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8c700343dd10ad9c15668b4cc3b70c53d0b6bc1156d817a896eb4a725cdc087
#. default-sha256: d78a5b79be7ba8ca1df9dc702f70384c220ea9c7b4c0543d8f75c22582be4c42
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He doesn’t trust me, but he also doesn’t know enough about me to decide what to do "
"yet. ⟪k:3⟫He needs time, and doing this gives him that time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non si fida di me, ma non sa ancora abbastanza sul mio conto da decidere cosa "
"fare. ⟪k:3⟫Ha bisogno di tempo,⟪k:4⟫e questo glielo darà."

#: scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97ccbd9e93589e7a310e5b6e99b39444bc10cd0a9f2af99df97c05bb3a738335
