msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he decides keeping me around is not to his advantage, he will act accordingly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se arriverà alla conclusione che tenermi qui non gli conviene, agirà di "
"conseguenza."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94d33b2e528908038e04afa5e907af4f9b3c013a204dd1fe75aef07eae4df712
