msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I... ⟪k:3⟫I might have.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But around the time Hayden Rhodes passed away..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mmh... ⟪k:3⟫Potrei averle viste.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ma nel periodo in cui Hayden Rhodes "
"morì..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be484debbb7e3a348ca9704778c526a4d9316e09cf6b38ca1d265a42549da3b9
#. default-sha256: 46f641892684fd1c9f1198f0e5c98032eb8045da7676810aa43f958d3f6b64f1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had become... ⟪k:3⟫merely another part of the cursed mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ero ormai diventata... ⟪k:3⟫parte della villa maledetta."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68bbc5714723e8c18873333668dc3c1dbbfaf6cc498018bb6ca99d4f15c55b7c
#. default-sha256: 03d81c9e9fde1c37c26fc30ba2bf494d65c5442945957bcc4af2ddae213acc84
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I suppose, much like the rules differ between the realms of the living and the dead, ⟪k:1⟫"
"so too do they differ for those who have lost their grip on reality.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Suppongo che, proprio come le regole tra il regno dei vivi e quello dei morti, ⟪k:1⟫"
"differiscono anche quelle tra coloro che hanno perso contatto con la realtà e quelli⟪k:2⟫che "
"invece l’hanno mantenuto.)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50364ce4daf545f061e935e6d6231e3b0ce45365597d5d625f9ce8ca7448e9b0
#. default-sha256: 9c9d48f80357c91e758f254b07d4309dfdd1b00e4745d610151043dc84d233ff
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone else is holding the reins.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My first guess would be the lord, but "
"regardless..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ qualcun altro a tenere le redini.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La mia prima ipotesi sarebbe il "
"lord..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 614d7b0584f07b80e3b0f13ac0fa1b446dc0846ac609028cb0c2cc55a3677e7e
#. default-sha256: 756cda0305ee8ae6f75048d9e2c4ea259237201aa67e97e0e4595c6138d7a42f
