msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they are not equals in this endeavor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma in ogni caso, non sono implicati in egual misura⟪k:3⟫in questa faccenda."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cce5a82eef7598967f0cfc0ab33766fe3117157fa2b53bcba285619aa203a6f7
#. default-sha256: 2d911aa906e6db455c42965805c50daf754befe9b5ecf5f63b1785ef58901ac7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he wants out, then maybe he would have agreed to help if we told him we’re here "
"to save Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se vuole uscirne fuori, allora forse avrebbe accettato⟪k:3⟫di aiutarci se gli "
"avessimo detto che siamo qui per⟪k:4⟫salvare Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16cd5e60d3025e9e1d177e0399e5f388ee0f8e67e439928b9069e40772693c61
#. default-sha256: 82c686ccd77668f2861b56f3d187ef778d3039a582908cfce999db55a4ce3805
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re right, we do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We know things we should have no way of knowing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Già, hai ragione.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Sappiamo cose che nessun altro conosce."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 210a51bc4c40852b31888510a5ccfa9d979d00a4d8c5eaf0186c536579b13856
#. default-sha256: a4791159e08219ccc7ee018a33e462c2c037f58d26e903236f94770a9ed7337a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They each have their reasons for locking Morgana up,⟪k:3⟫and if I’m right, they’re "
"doing it for other people.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s these powerful bonds driving them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ciascuno di loro aveva le proprie ragioni per rinchiudere Morgana, e se è come "
"penso, lo stanno facendo per altre persone.⟪k:3⟫ Sono quei forti legami a guidarli."

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cb398d75de92bbc43a58ef44a072cfbc0e6fb68761d01eac79d6a05755c9e04
#. default-sha256: 8a6e90edc1961504b8754d385aff414649464d61a25439d693824d2bf36580e1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Are they mere bonds, or is it fate that ties them together?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Sono davvero i loro legami, o è il destino a vincolarli?)"

